        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invitation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your voluntary participation in this research experiment.<br>You must decide whether this is your living room, or merely a dream.<br>If it is a dream, swallow the medicine and awaken.<br>If it is reality, open the door and finish the experiment.<br>*<i>This study was conducted in strict compliance with research ethics guidelines.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desomnia is a mystery walking simulation inspired by anomaly games such as The Exit 8. It offers about 30-120 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You participate in an experiment with your memory lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall asleep in the same space as your living room and wake up soon after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to determine if you are dreaming or if you are back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to wake up from your dream is to take the given medicine and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the experiment successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all anomalies — perhaps there is something more.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invitation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your voluntary participation in this research experiment.<br>You must decide whether this is your living room, or merely a dream.<br>If it is a dream, swallow the medicine and awaken.<br>If it is reality, open the door and finish the experiment.<br>*<i>This study was conducted in strict compliance with research ethics guidelines.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desomnia is a mystery walking simulation inspired by anomaly games such as The Exit 8. It offers about 30-120 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You participate in an experiment with your memory lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fall asleep in the same space as your living room and wake up soon after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to determine if you are dreaming or if you are back to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to wake up from your dream is to take the given medicine and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the experiment successfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all anomalies — perhaps there is something more.</p>",
